    "body": "I think this sounds good, but the default format strings aren't very compatible with missing `$version`. Modules wind up with one/two spaces from `$symbol` and one from the end of the format string. Maybe all the symbols should have one space less and the format strings switched to something like: `via [$symbol( $version)]($style) `?",
